  <content>
    <faultIsolation>
      <faultIsolationProcedure>
        <fault faultCode="NAYACAR-DA3-001"/>
        <faultDescr><descr>Fren zayıf tutuyor, pedal yumuşak ya da sert, frenlerken ses geliyor ya da araç bir yana çekiyor.</descr></faultDescr>
        <isolationProcedure>
          <preliminaryRqmts><reqCondGroup><noConds/></reqCondGroup><reqSupportEquips><noSupportEquips/></reqSupportEquips><reqSupplies><noSupplies/></reqSupplies><reqSpares><noSpares/></reqSpares><reqSafety><noSafety/></reqSafety></preliminaryRqmts>
          <isolationMainProcedure>
            <isolationStep id="stp-0001">
              <action>Motor kapalıyken pedala birkaç kez basın, sonra pedalı basılı tutarak motoru çalıştırın.</action>
              <isolationStepQuestion>Pedal hafifçe aşağı iniyor mu?</isolationStepQuestion>
              <isolationStepAnswer><yesNoAnswer><yesAnswer nextActionRefId="stp-0002"/><noAnswer nextActionRefId="end-booster"/></yesNoAnswer></isolationStepAnswer>
            </isolationStep>
            <isolationStep id="stp-0002">
              <action>Fren hidroliği deposunun seviyesine bakın.</action>
              <isolationStepQuestion>Seviye MIN çizgisinin altında mı?</isolationStepQuestion>
              <isolationStepAnswer><yesNoAnswer><yesAnswer nextActionRefId="stp-0003"/><noAnswer nextActionRefId="stp-0004"/></yesNoAnswer></isolationStepAnswer>
            </isolationStep>
            <isolationStep id="stp-0003">
              <action>Kaliperleri, hortumları ve boruları kaçağa karşı kontrol edin.</action>
              <isolationStepQuestion>Kaçak var mı?</isolationStepQuestion>
              <isolationStepAnswer><yesNoAnswer><yesAnswer nextActionRefId="end-leak"/><noAnswer nextActionRefId="stp-0004"/></yesNoAnswer></isolationStepAnswer>
            </isolationStep>
            <isolationStep id="stp-0004">
              <action>Ön balataların kalınlığını kaliperin içinden bakarak kontrol edin.</action>
              <isolationStepQuestion>Balata 1 mm'den ince mi?</isolationStepQuestion>
              <isolationStepAnswer><yesNoAnswer><yesAnswer nextActionRefId="end-pads"/><noAnswer nextActionRefId="stp-0005"/></yesNoAnswer></isolationStepAnswer>
            </isolationStep>
            <isolationStep id="stp-0005">
              <action>Diskin kalınlığını ve yüzeyini kontrol edin.</action>
              <isolationStepQuestion>Disk MIN değerinin altında ya da yüzeyi çizik mi?</isolationStepQuestion>
              <isolationStepAnswer><yesNoAnswer><yesAnswer nextActionRefId="end-disc"/><noAnswer nextActionRefId="stp-0006"/></yesNoAnswer></isolationStepAnswer>
            </isolationStep>
            <isolationStep id="stp-0006">
              <action>Kısa bir sürüşten sonra jantları elle yoklayın.</action>
              <isolationStepQuestion>Bir tekerlek ötekilerden belirgin sıcak mı?</isolationStepQuestion>
              <isolationStepAnswer><yesNoAnswer><yesAnswer nextActionRefId="end-caliper"/><noAnswer nextActionRefId="stp-0007"/></yesNoAnswer></isolationStepAnswer>
            </isolationStep>
            <isolationStep id="stp-0007">
              <action>Motor çalışırken pedalı orta kuvvetle 15 saniye basılı tutun.</action>
              <isolationStepQuestion>Pedal yavaşça yere iniyor mu?</isolationStepQuestion>
              <isolationStepAnswer><yesNoAnswer><yesAnswer nextActionRefId="end-master"/><noAnswer nextActionRefId="stp-0008"/></yesNoAnswer></isolationStepAnswer>
            </isolationStep>
            <isolationStep id="stp-0008">
              <action>Arka balataları kontrol edin.</action>
              <isolationStepQuestion>Arka balata 1 mm'den ince mi?</isolationStepQuestion>
              <isolationStepAnswer><yesNoAnswer><yesAnswer nextActionRefId="end-rear"/><noAnswer nextActionRefId="end-fluid"/></yesNoAnswer></isolationStepAnswer>
            </isolationStep>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-booster"><action>Fren servosu vakum almıyor: vakum hortumunu, çek valfi ve servoyu kontrol edip arızalı olanı değiştirin. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYACAR" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA3" subSystemCode="3" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="02" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="920" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-leak"><action>Kaçak yapan hortumu ya da boruyu değiştirin, sonra sistemin havasını alın. Kaçak giderilmeden aracı kullanmayın. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYACAR" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA3" subSystemCode="3" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="01" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="920" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-pads"><action>Ön balataları değiştirin. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYACAR" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA3" subSystemCode="1" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="921" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-disc"><action>Diskleri ölçün ve gerekirse değiştirin. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYACAR" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA3" subSystemCode="1" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="361" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-caliper"><action>O tekerleğin kaliper pistonu ya da kılavuz pimleri sıkışmış; kaliperi yenileyin. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYACAR" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA3" subSystemCode="1" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="01" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="920" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-master"><action>Ana merkez içeriden kaçırıyor; ana merkezi değiştirin. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYACAR" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA3" subSystemCode="3" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="920" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-rear"><action>Arka balataları değiştirin. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYACAR" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA3" subSystemCode="2" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="921" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-fluid"><action>Pedal yumuşak ama kaçak yok: sistemde hava var ya da hidrolik nem çekmiş. Hidroliği değiştirip havasını alın. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYACAR" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA3" subSystemCode="3" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="210" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
          </isolationMainProcedure>
          <closeRqmts><reqCondGroup><noConds/></reqCondGroup></closeRqmts>
        </isolationProcedure>
      </faultIsolationProcedure>
    </faultIsolation>
  </content>
